WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:14.530
"Eels eat fish," Mo said.

2
00:00:14.531 --> 00:00:17.588
"I must be brave!"

3
00:00:17.589 --> 00:00:20.643
"You can do it, Mo," Cora said.

4
00:00:20.644 --> 00:00:25.314
Mo took a deep breath.

5
00:00:25.315 --> 00:00:30.317
He tried to grow big and spiky.

6
00:00:30.318 --> 00:00:33.034
But he flipped over and floated.

7
00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:36.362
"Ugh! I can't do it!" he said.

8
00:00:36.363 --> 00:00:41.341
Cora grabbed Mo fast.

9
00:00:41.342 --> 00:00:46.310
She darted behind some tall plants.

10
00:00:46.311 --> 00:00:49.249
"Stay behind me, Mo," Cora said.

11
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:53.079
"And don't move!"

12
00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.564
Cora's skin changed color.

13
00:00:55.565 --> 00:00:57.760
Now it matched the plants.

14
00:00:57.761 --> 00:01:00.881
Cora and Mo froze.

15
00:01:00.882 --> 00:01:14.260
The eels swam right by!

16
00:01:14.261 --> 00:01:21.873
"The arrow!" Cora said. "Let's go!"

17
00:01:21.874 --> 00:01:27.002
Cora and Mo followed the arrow again.

18
00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:32.185
At last it stopped.

19
00:01:32.186 --> 00:01:40.066
"Look," Mo said. "It's pointing down."

20
00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:47.805
Cora dived into the seaweed below. "Sasha!"

21
00:01:47.806 --> 00:01:52.059
Sasha was caught in a tangle of seaweed.

22
00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:55.289
Cora used her arms to free her.

23
00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:58.173
"Thanks, Cora!" Sasha said.

24
00:01:58.174 --> 00:02:14.466
"You saved me!" Sasha swam home.

25
00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:21.374
Cora and Mo followed the arrow again.

26
00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:23.966
It flew back to the shell.

27
00:02:23.967 --> 00:02:28.898
The shell closed.

28
00:02:28.899 --> 00:02:33.410
"Phew! That was scary!" Mo said.

29
00:02:33.411 --> 00:02:38.278
Cora nodded. "It was fun too.

30
00:02:38.279 --> 00:02:43.923
We found Sasha—and a magic compass!"

